WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.432 --> 00:00:08.680
The Browser on the left holds every sound. Presets are ready-made instruments and effect chains.

2
00:00:09.501 --> 00:00:14.238
Factory sounds are drums, eight-oh-eights and effects. Click one to hear it.

3
00:00:16.936 --> 00:00:21.673
Right-click a sound and choose More like this to find the closest ones by timbre.

4
00:00:22.885 --> 00:00:27.901
To change a channel’s sound, select it, right-click a preset and choose Load onto Keys.

5
00:00:32.703 --> 00:00:35.118
Press play to hear the new sound in your beat.

6
00:00:40.175 --> 00:00:44.865
Want more? Download free sound packs in Home, Sounds. They show up here too.
